You really need to get out more often.  Kings Quest is not a modified version of Nethack.
It is a graphical fantasy adventure series written by Roberta Williams of Sierra.  This
series has been around since 1985 and is the best selling adventure series in computer
history.

As for the original poster this is not the appropriate group to try to get hints from.  You
might try calling the Sierra BBS.  They have a user friendly menu system to let you
find what game and what stage of the game you are in.  Also you might try Compuserve.


